def latest_prices(history):
    latest = {}
    for ticker, closes in history.items():
        if len(closes) > 0:
            latest[ticker] = closes[-1]
    return latest

explain.text:
`.items()` hands back each ticker with its list, and the length check skips a listing with no closes yet.

